# The agent is told to commit often, so anything huge and regenerable must be excluded here:
# a `git add -A` would otherwise commit a multi-GB .venv (torch + CUDA on GPU campaigns) and
# 1000-path prediction files at ~5.5MB each. Committed weights are the exception — the champion
# must stay runnable offline, so DO NOT add model artifacts to this list.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
miner_outputs/
market_data/
